units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc v_Ni_lattice
region simulation_box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 simulation_box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 v_Ni_mass
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * v_potential_file
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 10 check yes
timestep 0.001
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 600 4928459 dist gaussian mom yes rot yes units box
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal enthalpy vol density
thermo_modify flush yes
fix ensemble all npt temp 300 2500 v_Tdamp iso 1.01325 1.01325 v_Pdamp
run v_run_steps
